<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>com.lonje.Froxel</id>
  <name>Froxel</name>
  <summary>Voxel editor with a path tracer</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <developer id="com.lonje">
    <name>Roman Vasilyev</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Froxel is a voxel editor for MagicaVoxel .vox models. Sculpt with
      brushes, lines, boxes, and faces, rig models into parts with bones and
      clips, and see them in a GPU path tracer with an atmospheric sky, metal,
      and glass.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Edits .vox scenes with their groups, layers, and animation frames</li>
      <li>Imports glTF and OBJ meshes and voxelizes them</li>
      <li>Exports glTF with merged faces, a colour atlas, and baked occlusion</li>
      <li>An MCP server lets an AI agent build and edit models</li>
      <li>Rhai scripting, and bridges to Godot and Blender</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">froxel.desktop</launchable>
